's in your face, feel free to give them a smack.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":"_0"},{"id":"d_counseling_rosanna_04_7","type":"Speech","speaker":"rosanna","key":"Locale_Counseling:d_counseling_rosanna_04_7","text":"I'll take care of the rest.","jump":"d_counseling_rosanna_04_12","exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":"_0"},{"id":"d_counseling_rosanna_04_8","type":"Speech","speaker":"rosanna","key":"Locale_Counseling:d_counseling_rosanna_04_8","text":"A perfect answer. For me, that is.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":"_0"},{"id":"d_counseling_rosanna_04_9","type":"Speech","speaker":"rosanna","key":"Locale_Counseling:d_counseling_rosanna_04_9","text":"I'm not so sure about you, though.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":"_0"},{"id":"d_counseling_rosanna_04_10","type":"Speech","speaker":"rosanna","key":"Locale_Counseling:d_counseling_rosanna_04_10","text":"The world you live in is different from mine. Yours is governed by rules.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":"_0"},{"id":"d_counseling_rosanna_04_11","type":"Speech","speaker":"rosanna","key":"Locale_Counseling:d_counseling_rosanna_04_11","text":"Don't feel as if you have to impress me.","jump":"d_counseling_rosanna_04_12","exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":"_0"},{"id":"d_counseling_rosanna_04_12","type":"Narration","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_Counseling:d_counseling_rosanna_04_12","text":"I have a short counseling session with Rosanna.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":"none","bgArt":"none","image":null,"bgm"